---
---

<section id="experience" class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="section-kicker">The product experience</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading mt-6">
        A budgeting app built around the moments people usually ignore.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-copy mt-6">
        Most finance tools tell you what happened after the money is gone. Conscia is designed to help
        before the tap, during the log, and after the emotion settles.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="feature-panel">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="chip-devil">Before the purchase</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--devil-deep)]">Impulse meets reason</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink-strong)]">
          Pre-purchase conversations that feel like the app already knows your habits.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
          Ask about a purchase, see the budget impact, and get two distinct perspectives instead of one
          generic chatbot answer.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 mock-card p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Suggested category</span>
            <span class="chip-gold">Dining</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
            Nearby suggestions, recent categories, and the amount all work together so the app can help
            without getting in the way.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-panel">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="chip-angel">While you log</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--angel-deep)]">Fast, but thoughtful</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink-strong)]">
          A transaction flow that stays calm even when you are entering things quickly.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
          Hero amount input, smart location suggestions, voice capture, and category memory all keep the
          experience moving without turning it into a spreadsheet.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 mock-card p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Recent categories</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--ink-muted)]">Local only</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="chip-gold">Gaming</span>
            <span class="chip-angel">Dining</span>
            <span class="chip-devil">Shopping</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-panel">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="chip-gold">After the purchase</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Regret has memory</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink-strong)]">
          Reflection, regret, and patterns that build a sharper picture over time.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
          Conscia does not stop at “you overspent.” It connects hesitation, regret, reflection, and
          repeated choices into signals you can actually act on.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 mock-card p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--navy)]">Regret memory alert</span>
            <span class="chip-devil">Cooling off</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
            “You’ve marked 3 of your last 5 gaming purchases as regret or not sure. Maybe pause before the
            next one.”
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
